          "text": "    {\"name\":\"constrained_dihedral_scan\", \"value\":points, \"unit\":\"mixed (deg, hartree, boolean)\", \"sources\":sources, \"formula\":\"E_rel = (E - E_min)*2625.499639 kJ/mol per hartree\", \"artifacts\":sorted(set(all_artifacts)), \"limitations\":[\"Energies are raw ORCA final single point energies.\", \"Nonconverged points are flagged and are not treated as successful points.\"]},"
